Section EnqRefillPost.
  Variables (sp gp tp t0 t1 t2 xa2 xa6 xa7 t3 t4 t5 t6 xra xs0 xs1 xs2 xs3 xs4 xs5 s7 s8 s9 s10 s11 : word) (F : bvmap 5 word) (fc : bv 32) (m m0 : mem).
