  Hypothesis HDQ : 0 <= hdq < 2^64. Hypothesis QCR : 0 <= qcache < 2^64.
  Hypothesis LAh : ltac2:(zQ "h10!lv5!p5!ig3!jh7!msb!htb!q2!r0!jjb!jlc!h9!ik5!mn2!luc!hvd!isa!io9>0@1$9@3$8$a?1kZ@2$2@4$f$b?1m?2LA@3$6$5@1$e@1$h0Z@1$7$5@2$2@2$0$c?2LA@2$2@2$0@2$1?2LA$3@1$d?5HCEIL@2$2@2$4@2$0@2$1?2TH+hgg0?2LA@2$0@2$1?2LA$3?2TH@2$4@2$0@2$1?1B$3?2LA@2$0@2$1?2LA$3?1B").
