  Hypothesis SBR : ltac2:(zQ "b0!ig3!p5!lv5!jjb!h9!mjc!mn2!luc!mnc!mo9!mm9@1$5@2$0@2$2$6?2sb@2$0@2$2@2$1@2$1?2sb$9$8@1$7?5HCEIL@3$3$4@2$a?2sb+hggg0Z").
